</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>But when Thou dost anneal Thy story</l><l>In glass, Thy life to shine within</l><l>The holy preachers, light of glory</l><l>More radiant grows and more doth win,</l><l>Which else shows waterish, bleak, and thin.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The life and doctrine blent in one</l><l>As light and color mingled, bring</l><l>A strong regard; but speech alone</l><l>Doth vanish like a flaring thing,</l><l>And in the ear, not spirit ring.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
